---
description: Working with Astro layouts
globs: astro-app/src/layouts/*.astro
alwaysApply: false
---
[astro.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/astro.mdc)

- Layouts are located in `astro-app/src/layouts/`
- `BaseLayout.astro` provides the base HTML structure
- `Layout.astro` wraps pages with common UI elements (Header, etc.)
- Pages should import and use `Layout` from `@/layouts/Layout.astro`
- Make the user experience generic and streamlined
- Layouts handle authentication state via `Astro.locals.isAuthed` and `Astro.locals.user`
- Pass page-specific props (like `title`) to Layout components